      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im looking at this house contract in seattle and i keep seeing the word \"escrow\" everywhere. im kinda lost. can u basically explain what an escrow agent actually does and why they need to hold my money for a while? thanks",
      "source": "evaluator"
